    "collapsible_content_iGUxFe": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_MxwqD7": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>What makes ëkcos different from standard products?</strong>",
            "row_content": "<p>ëkcos products last significantly longer (60+ days), release a consistently strong <strong>fragrance </strong>and include advanced <strong>antisplash </strong>features. Despite being 60+days lasting, they don’t cost twice as much as other high quality 30-day alternatives – yet deliver much more in hygiene, sustainability, cost savings, and user satisfaction.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "enable_highlight": false,
            "highlight_style": "marker"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_EcaLVM": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>How long do ëkcos urinal screens last?</strong>",
            "row_content": "<p>•<strong>xcrën HD </strong>and <strong>ëkcoscreen</strong>: 60+ days</p><p>•<strong>powërscreen </strong>and <strong>ürolite</strong>: up to 30 days</p>",
            "page": "",
            "enable_highlight": false,
            "highlight_style": "marker"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_hAYLLq": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>What is antisplash technology and how does it work?</strong>",
            "row_content": "<p>ëkcos screens feature a <strong>bristle system </strong>that effectively breaks the urine stream and prevents splash back. This keeps the surrounding floor cleaner and reduces bacterial contamination.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "enable_highlight": false,
            "highlight_style": "marker"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_PydxKU": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>What are the main environmental benefits of ëkcos products?</strong>",
            "row_content": "<p>- All ëkcos products are <strong>99% biodegradable</strong> in bioactive landfills within 5 years</p><p>- Made from <strong>recycled materials</strong></p><p>- Packaged in eco-friendly cellophane bags</p><p>- Environmentally friendly fragrance composition (non-toxic to the environment, especially wastewater), VOC-compliant</p><p>- <strong>ëkcoscreen</strong> and <strong>xcrën HD</strong> lasts 60+ days compared to the typical 30 days on the market = extended time before replacement is needed</p><p>- Passive interior fragrance complete solution = urinal screen + frësh drop and ëkco clip; <strong>no aerosols </strong>or concentrated and heated aromatic oils (some of which may be carcinogenic)</p>",
            "page": "",
            "enable_highlight": false,
            "highlight_style": "marker"
          }
        }
      },
